OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits murder of mum-of-four
OL,4,Awho was stabbed in the back
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to the murder
OL,7,Fof a mum-of-four who died after being
OL,8,Fstabbed in the back following a fight.
OL,10,FCharlene Dowsell, 41, died on 18 July
OL,11,Fafter an altercation outside a property
OL,12,Fin St Vincent Road, near Newport city
OL,13,Fcentre.
OL,15,FGwent Police said officers, including
OL,16,Fthose with firearms, were called at
OL,17,F01:37 BST and told "a male and female
OL,18,Fwere fighting and the female was
OL,19,Fbleeding".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
