OL,3,GNEWSAMan admits murder of mum-of-four
OL,4,Awho was stabbed in the back
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowsell was found a short distance away
OL,7,Fnear Chepstow Road, and "despite first
OL,8,Faid" was pronounced dead at 03:15. She
OL,9,Fwas later identified by her father.
